                        ],
                        "form": "буду/будешь… зала́зать"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "620b1aec-d34d-3141-8871-922d63a4f858",
                        "entry_id": "bc603213-f84e-3493-a15c-db5fc6e026aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "то же, что залазить, залезать"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8025b952-5335-4e4e-a9fc-6d1b15287ed6",
                                "sense_id": "620b1aec-d34d-3141-8871-922d63a4f858",
                                "text": "В выжженном сизом небе — ни облачка. Подувал горячий, пыльный ветерок. Утки залазали в огромное каменное корыто, барахтались в нём, грязные куры присмирели, присев вдоль плетня."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9084cbeb-246b-4661-b380-8a87139ddeb2",
                                "sense_id": "620b1aec-d34d-3141-8871-922d63a4f858",
                                "text": "Счастливая Киприда. В поле выйду после дойки, // Отложив все хлопоты. // У моей подруги Зойки — // Комбайнёр без опыта… Рецензия. Он мне титьки измусолил // Лапами чумазыми. // Эх, моя ты, бабья доля, // Всякие залазают…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5f424fe-343b-44d4-9cca-1a09687115d7",
                                "sense_id": "620b1aec-d34d-3141-8871-922d63a4f858",
                                "text": "И в пять часов решил удрать // (Только дневальный захотел поспать). // Вот на крыльцо я выхожу, // К забору подхожу, // Залазаю, на корточках сижу, // В раздумье, в нерешительности себя раскачиваю // Из стороны в сторону, последней капли ожидаю, // И вдруг толчок — // Дневальный выскочил из‑за угла, как волчок, // И я уже внизу, бегу .."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "844bd6f2-6660-4caa-b5f6-423fa50bb886",
                                "sense_id": "620b1aec-d34d-3141-8871-922d63a4f858",
                                "text": "Кот Барон любил отдыхать на крыше бани. Всякий раз, нашкодив и получив трёпку от сэнсэя, он залазал на крышу и там как будто растворялся в пространстве, растягиваясь во всю длину своего тела."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d3e973a-955e-4ebb-89e8-26cff658a03e",
                                "sense_id": "620b1aec-d34d-3141-8871-922d63a4f858",
                                "text": "Военком отдал приказ // заберут в АбхАзию… // Может быть, в последний раз // на тебя зАлАзАю! // Я от армии решил // откосить спокойно… // И невесту попросил, // чтоб рожала двойню!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a6e05f9e-b7a5-41e9-be8d-992a0d0acf60",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc603213-f84e-3493-a15c-db5fc6e026aa",
                        "source_sense_id": "620b1aec-d34d-3141-8871-922d63a4f858",
                        "target_lang_word": "climb",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "climb",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "daef4c3a-ef7c-3fbe-b7e3-04b93ee01d55",
                                        "entry_id": "484720d3-2176-3de1-856d-4464f9b46a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To ascend; rise; to go up."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9f35bf7-65e3-4343-97d5-ac5de7412f1c",
                                                "sense_id": "daef4c3a-ef7c-3fbe-b7e3-04b93ee01d55",
                                                "text": "Prices climbed steeply."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e18f44fe-61f4-46f9-8f1e-4b422f19ba17",
                                                "sense_id": "daef4c3a-ef7c-3fbe-b7e3-04b93ee01d55",
                                                "text": "Black vapours climb aloft, and cloud the day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "661be46c-985a-475a-bc97-4e05d85d122c",
                                                "sense_id": "daef4c3a-ef7c-3fbe-b7e3-04b93ee01d55",
                                                "text": "So we continue climbing to the saddle of the Kleine Scheidegg, where ahead there comes into view the wide expanse of the Grindelwald valley, backed by the snowy crown of the Wetterhorn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac134ab8-84d2-4d7b-a63d-12b0b94a3038",
                                                "sense_id": "daef4c3a-ef7c-3fbe-b7e3-04b93ee01d55",
                                                "text": "After Bridge of Orchy, the line climbs steeply into the wild country of Rannoch Moor. The railway builders chose a different route across the moor from the road - we are completely on our own up here."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10587d5c-1c7b-338a-81d5-1232e5856759",
                                        "entry_id": "484720d3-2176-3de1-856d-4464f9b46a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To mount; to move upwards on."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0da153a1-b096-4eb5-b7a0-48094988c2bc",
                                                "sense_id": "10587d5c-1c7b-338a-81d5-1232e5856759",
                                                "text": "climbing a tree"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62dd6369-bd57-4579-9789-606a9b77a97e",
                                                "sense_id": "10587d5c-1c7b-338a-81d5-1232e5856759",
                                                "text": "They climbed the mountain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef86eab4-a295-4626-9235-320a0434df87",
                                                "sense_id": "10587d5c-1c7b-338a-81d5-1232e5856759",
                                                "text": "Other Hooverian devices become familiar too. Characters often have names that are so obscure they barely seem like real names (Ryle, Lowen, Chastin, Atlas, Crew) but might wind up climbing the baby name list — now you know why — in a few years’ time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e05798a-e925-3993-b479-546298c2838a",
                                        "entry_id": "484720d3-2176-3de1-856d-4464f9b46a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To scale; to get to the top of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9898c688-3255-4e9f-88b4-24488543969b",
                                                "sense_id": "8e05798a-e925-3993-b479-546298c2838a",
                                                "text": "He is a curly-haired schoolboy barely in his teens, but 13-year-old Jordan Romero from California has become the youngest person to climb Mount Everest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef39c09e-34e6-307c-86fb-71377c8e34b7",
                                        "entry_id": "484720d3-2176-3de1-856d-4464f9b46a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move (especially up and down something) by gripping with the hands and using the feet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25f3b6fa-f11d-4ba8-b8cf-708f836fa4c6",
                                                "sense_id": "ef39c09e-34e6-307c-86fb-71377c8e34b7",
                                                "text": "My legs were so stiff and my arms so sore that this morning barely could climb out of bed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68790b0d-891c-4fb7-ab35-377958a7f584",
                                                "sense_id": "ef39c09e-34e6-307c-86fb-71377c8e34b7",
                                                "text": "A priest clad in a white robe climbs the tree and with a golden sickle cuts the mistletoe, which is caught in a white cloth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbb35724-1136-4a9f-8414-94b22d2a3772",
                                                "sense_id": "ef39c09e-34e6-307c-86fb-71377c8e34b7",
                                                "text": "She thought she must have been mistaken at first, for none of the scarecrows in Kansas ever wink; but presently the figure nodded its head to her in a friendly way. Then she climbed down from the fence and walked up to it, while Toto ran around the pole and barked."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c76e14be-0a8f-46e0-a359-60a9ca4ee50f",
                                                "sense_id": "ef39c09e-34e6-307c-86fb-71377c8e34b7",
                                                "text": "Cutter and Bolan climbed around the furniture and piled into the back of the truck."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cadfcb3f-6f1c-3d40-8aa7-aa729ab688d4",
                                        "entry_id": "484720d3-2176-3de1-856d-4464f9b46a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To practise the sport of climbing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "544d93e6-f30d-3cb4-8fd0-791d5db7c987",
                                        "entry_id": "484720d3-2176-3de1-856d-4464f9b46a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To jump high."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9b7254d-1be4-4f8a-b127-44cb8357a5c0",
                                                "sense_id": "544d93e6-f30d-3cb4-8fd0-791d5db7c987",
                                                "text": "The defender climbed majestically at the near post to convert Johnson's corner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cb14a1e-282f-4b2b-8529-e37afe9b6ade",
                                                "sense_id": "544d93e6-f30d-3cb4-8fd0-791d5db7c987",
                                                "text": "As the game moved towards injury time, the Ospreys forced a line-out which Jonathan Thomas climbed high to take."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b20fff08-cfc1-4bd3-9c9c-108fe12077b4",
                                                "sense_id": "544d93e6-f30d-3cb4-8fd0-791d5db7c987",
                                                "text": "Four minutes of stoppage time were virtually up when Ricketts climbed to head in the equaliser from substitute Nicky Southall's centre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "620511cb-2750-3adc-9bdf-1ac40e9f83b4",
                                        "entry_id": "484720d3-2176-3de1-856d-4464f9b46a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move to a higher position on the social ladder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0bb3a1c5-2b75-3883-a950-b25a731f6c14",
                                        "entry_id": "484720d3-2176-3de1-856d-4464f9b46a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move to a higher position on a chart, table, society, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d119872-e139-4cbd-8010-6709e8589991",
                                                "sense_id": "0bb3a1c5-2b75-3883-a950-b25a731f6c14",
                                                "text": "The hit song has climbed to the number one spot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "196e2316-c906-3b56-8b2f-17c1146369a9",
                                        "entry_id": "484720d3-2176-3de1-856d-4464f9b46a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of plants, to grow upwards by clinging to something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "climb",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f73a176-31f0-368c-87a4-cd33c8e0602d",
                                        "entry_id": "3a7ecb9c-5467-3f10-84c9-787feab1ef43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of climbing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "280b32be-f87b-4045-9557-47998fcd735a",
                                                "sense_id": "3f73a176-31f0-368c-87a4-cd33c8e0602d",
                                                "text": "Make sure that you keep checking to see that everything remains safe throughout the climb."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18cc6fca-530f-3e6c-b917-b98346a31840",
                                        "entry_id": "3a7ecb9c-5467-3f10-84c9-787feab1ef43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of getting to somewhere more elevated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7887b79f-3344-4689-8a6b-d2ad5ef33c3a",
                                                "sense_id": "18cc6fca-530f-3e6c-b917-b98346a31840",
                                                "text": "The Mur de Péguère is a savage little climb, its last four kilometres a narrow tunnel of trees and excited spectators urging on the straining riders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2a46ad8-be7c-4c16-ba9f-c59b1bce8539",
                                                "sense_id": "18cc6fca-530f-3e6c-b917-b98346a31840",
                                                "text": "I guess the room wasn't so bad, except for the climb to get there. The stairs were destined to be a serious health hazard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "510c00f6-2f8b-3941-9699-bc98cfbc7d3e",
                                        "entry_id": "3a7ecb9c-5467-3f10-84c9-787feab1ef43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An effort of moving upward."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "950bbe94-0aa5-4838-9586-580b27012b3e",
                                                "sense_id": "510c00f6-2f8b-3941-9699-bc98cfbc7d3e",
                                                "text": "After a decade of prosperity, millions of Asians are likely to be pushed into poverty, and the climb out of poverty will stall for millions of others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a732ee72-6e16-4ec5-a7ae-7d02ade6b7d5",
                                                "sense_id": "510c00f6-2f8b-3941-9699-bc98cfbc7d3e",
                                                "text": "This memorial dedicated to those / Who persished on the climb"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42e4af82-1cb0-4bb1-9cd5-8ee5ec566fd6",
                                                "sense_id": "510c00f6-2f8b-3941-9699-bc98cfbc7d3e",
                                                "text": "An extended climb in Treasury yields risks exacerbating the pressures that have dogged a broad array of assets in recent months."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
